  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NCA&apos;s civil society programme with LWF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF is seeking justice by mobilising the Lutheran constituency for advocacy at national, regional and global levels, and focusing on connecting local advocates and their priorities to global mechanisms such as the UNFCC, CSW, CPD and the sessions of the Human Rights Council. The programme  mobilises locally and globally to end GBV, fight inequality, struggle for environmental and climate justice, and mutual capacity-sharing and development.

The Norwegian Church Aid&#x2019;s civil society programme is implemented through 17 country programmes in Africa, Asia, the Middle East and Latin America. The country programmes are supported by regional and global advocacy programmes, strengthening local engagement in regional and global action.</narrative>
  </description>
